Source: worker
Section: admin
Priority: extra
Maintainer: %%PACKAGE_VENDOR%%
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 11),
               linux-libc-dev,
               pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.1.4
Homepage: https://github.com/hongzhidao/worker

Package: worker
Section: admin
Architecture: any
Depends: lsb-base,
         ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: dynamically configured application server
 Worker is a runtime and delivery environment for modern distributed
 applications. It runs the application code in multiple languages
 (PHP, Python, Go, etc.), and tightly couples it with traffic delivery
 in and out of the application. Take this application server and proxy
 directly in the cloud / container environments and fully control your app
 dynamically via an API.

Package: worker-dbg
Section: debug
Architecture: any
Priority: extra
Depends: worker (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Worker (debug symbols)
 This package contains the debugging symbols for Worker.

Package: worker-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Depends: worker (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Worker (development files)
 Library and include files required for Worker modules development.
